  "倒计时": "Countdown",
  "倒计时结束，土星五号点火升空。它并不朝月球直冲，而是先直上、再慢慢倾倒——真正的奔月路线，要先学会绕开地球。": "When the countdown ends, Saturn V ignites and climbs. It does not charge straight at the Moon; it rises first, then slowly tips over—the real route to the Moon begins by learning to orbit Earth.",
  "地球停泊轨道": "Earth parking orbit",
