  "抵达：环绕月球飞行": "Arrived: orbiting the Moon",
  "第三天，月球引力接手。在月球背面——地球看不见的地方——发动机反向点火六分钟，把速度降到每秒 1.7 公里，滑入环月轨道。从点火到这一刻，三天出头。": "On day three, the Moon’s gravity takes over. Behind the Moon — hidden from Earth — the engine fires retrograde for six minutes, slowing to 1.7 km/s and slipping into lunar orbit. From ignition to this moment: just over three days.",
