  "环月轨道": "Orbiting the Moon",
  "环月两圈后再点一次火，轨道圆化到 110 公里——此后每两小时绕月一圈。转到合适的位置，还会遇见著名的「地出」：蓝色地球从月平线上升起。从点火到此刻：第四天。": "Two loops around the Moon, then one final burn, and the orbit circularizes at 110 km — from here the craft circles the Moon every two hours. At the right turn you will catch the famous Earthrise: the blue Earth lifting off the lunar horizon. From ignition to this moment: day four.",
