  "接近月球": "Approaching the Moon",
  "接下来是约三天的滑行，几乎不烧燃料。地球在身后缩成一颗蓝点——画面里地球、月球的大小和距离全是真实比例，中间是真的什么都没有。": "Next come about three days of coasting on almost no fuel. Earth shrinks to a blue dot behind — every size and distance on screen is true scale, and there is genuinely nothing in between.",
