  "去月球，为什么不能直着飞？": "Why cannot we fly straight to the Moon?",
  "去月球要几天？": "Four Days to the Moon",
  "绕地球一圈半后，TLI 点火六分钟，把速度提到每秒 11 公里甩向月球。注意：此刻月球并不在终点——半透明的影子，标出三天后它才会到达的位置。": "After one and a half laps of Earth, the TLI burn runs six minutes and pushes the craft to 11 km/s toward the Moon. Note: the Moon is not at the finish line yet — the translucent ghost marks where it will arrive three days from now.",
