  "先绕地球飞，不急着去月球": "Lap Earth first — the Moon can wait",
  "现在，你是月球的卫星": "Now you orbit the Moon",
  "抛掉烧空的油箱": "Drop the burned-out tanks",
  "两分半后一级火箭烧完，直接分离、坠回大海；再过四分钟，二级也抛掉。去月球不背空油箱——每扔一级，剩下的火箭就更轻、更快。": "Two and a half minutes in, the first stage burns out — it separates and falls back toward the ocean; four minutes later, the second stage is dropped too. No empty tanks on the way to the Moon — each stage you shed makes what remains lighter and faster.",
  "回头看，地球在变小": "Look back — Earth is shrinking",
  "TLI 关机后，末级火箭也分离了——剩下的旅程，宇航员只有小小的指令舱。回头看一眼：完整的地球挂在身后，像一弯蓝色新月，而且一天比一天小。": "After TLI cutoff, the final stage separates too — for the rest of the journey the crew has only the small command module. Look back: the whole Earth hangs behind like a blue crescent, and it grows smaller every day.",
  "火箭并不直接奔向月球。它先横着加速到每秒 7.8 公里，进入 190 公里高的地球轨道——轨道不是悬浮不动，而是一边下坠、一边错过地面。": "The rocket does not head straight for the Moon. It first accelerates sideways to 7.8 km/s and settles into a 190 km Earth orbit — orbit is not hovering in place; it is falling while endlessly missing the ground.",
